# Writing style

Never use the dash character `-` (no em/en dashes, no hyphenated compounds, no dash-led bullets). Use commas, rephrasing, `•`, or numbers.

```
❌ Ships next week — pending review.
✅ Ships next week, pending review.
```

Never write "it is not X, it is Y" contrasts. State the positive directly.

```
❌ It is not a bug fix, it is a reliability improvement.
✅ It is a reliability improvement.
```
